@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
title Plan/Ticket Loop - Planning, Dependencies and One Merge

state "Define one feature Plan\nThen behavior Tickets and ordered Slices\nAcceptance / scope / dependencies / validation" as plan
state "Resolve repository + base + Issue access\nSearch stable plan/Ticket markers" as lookup
state "Reuse unique matches or create Issues\nOne Plan + all child Tickets\nPersist Plan Status / Branch / Base / PR\nPersist Ticket status / dependencies / acceptance" as persist
state "Planning blocked\nReport ambiguity or failed persistence\nKeep created Issue links; no local ticket mirror" as plan_blocked #FFF4CC
state "Create/resume Plan branch\nVerify Plan Branch/Base metadata\nPlan Status: in_progress" as branch
state "Select unfinished Ticket\nRead Ticket + Plan evidence\nUse the shared Plan branch" as select
state "Dependency gate\nPrerequisite Ticket/Slices validated?" as dependency
state "Dependency wait [blocked; Issue open]\nRecord prerequisite + reason\nNo new branch or merge" as wait_dep #FFF4CC
state "Execute Ticket Slices\nSee ticket-slice-loop.svg\nAll Tickets/Slices share Plan branch" as slices
state "Publish / review / fix / merge Plan PR\nSee ticket-review-loop.svg\nOne delivery boundary for all Tickets" as deliver
state "Verified Plan merge\nClean exact source branch; sync base\nStatus: done; close Plan + child Tickets" as done #DCFCE7
state "Reconcile State/Docs if changed\nTracked follow-up edits use a new branch + PR" as state_docs
state "Plan complete\nOne Plan PR merged; no open blockers" as complete #DCFCE7

[*] --> plan
plan --> lookup
lookup --> persist : no ambiguity; access works
lookup --> plan_blocked : access failure / duplicate matches
persist --> plan_blocked : any required write fails
plan_blocked --> lookup : cause resolved; re-read first
persist --> branch : all required writes verified
branch --> select
select --> dependency : Ticket remains
select --> deliver : all Ticket acceptance passes
dependency --> wait_dep : not yet validated
wait_dep --> dependency : dependency event / scheduled recheck
dependency --> slices : prerequisites validated on Plan branch
slices --> select : more Tickets
slices --> deliver : all Ticket acceptance + integration checks pass
slices --> plan : design/scope assumption invalid\nupdate same Issues; preserve valid work
deliver --> done : reviewed head + required checks + merge verified
done --> state_docs
state_docs --> complete : Plan delivered
complete --> [*]

note right of persist
Plan Issue: feature milestones + delivery metadata + Ticket links.
Ticket Issue: behavior + nested Slice plan + current state.
One Plan = one Issue = one implementation branch / PR / merge.
Tickets and Slices do not create separate delivery branches.
end note
note right of wait_dep
Unchanged state is not a reason for a tight retry loop.
Work on a different ready Ticket only when authorized
and ownership boundaries permit; keep dependencies intact.
end note
@enduml
